    <details class="pl-card-d">
      <summary>FirestoreBackupServiceTest.kt — characterization: batch chunking + large-text + auth-guard + user-meta</summary>
      <div class="pl-card">
        <p>Extend the existing 8-test file with ~7 characterization tests pinning the surfaces <code>firestore-dedup</code> and <code>streaming-restore</code> will refactor. Key assertions: <code>backupArticlesPaginated</code> chunks at <code>WRITE_BATCH_LIMIT=20</code> (one <code>batch.commit()</code> per chunk); large-text (>900KB) stores to subcollection and nulls inline text; <code>restoreAllArticlesPaginated</code> accumulates all pages in one list (the OOM baseline); all methods return <code>Result.failure</code> when unauthenticated.</p>
