    <details class="pl-card-d">
      <summary>FirestoreSyncManagerTest.kt — new: auth-guard, tag-backup N+1, adaptive chunks, sync strategy</summary>
      <div class="pl-card">
        <p>New characterization test class (~180 lines, ~10 tests). Uses MockK for <code>FirebaseAuth</code>, <code>FirebaseFirestore</code>, <code>ArticleDao</code>, <code>FirestoreBackupService</code>; <code>StandardTestDispatcher</code> + <code>runTest</code> + <code>advanceUntilIdle()</code>. Pins: (1) auth-guard on <code>syncLocalChanges</code>/<code>performFullSync</code>; (2) tag-backup per-article batch loop (N+1 quirk); (3) adaptive chunk size (200 for first sync &gt;1000 articles, 50 otherwise); (4) first-sync restore scenario dispatch; (5) conflict resolution timestamp comparison; (6) bidirectional sync ordering.</p>
